msgstr "これだけ雨が降るとやはり困る。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
